## Quick Start

### 1. Install Dependencies

```bash
# Install pkg dependencies
cd pkg
go mod tidy

# Install app dependencies
cd ../apps/{{.AppName}}
{{- if not .UseLocalFramework}}
go get github.com/KOMKZ/go-yogan-framework@latest
{{- end}}
go mod tidy
```

### 2. Start Scheduler

```bash
cd apps/{{.AppName}}

# Start cron scheduler (runs all tasks)
go run main.go start
```

### 3. Run Single Task

```bash
# Run demo task manually
go run main.go run --task demo
```

### 4. Build

```bash
# From project root
make build-all

# Or build specific app
make build APP={{.AppName}}
```

## Adding New Tasks

1. Create handler in `apps/{{.AppName}}/internal/handler/`:

```go
package handler

func (h *MyHandler) MyTask() {
    // Task implementation
}
```

2. Register task in `apps/{{.AppName}}/internal/command/start.go`:

```go
_, err := app.RegisterTask(
    "0 */5 * * *",  // cron expression
    myHandler.MyTask,
    gocron.WithName("my_task"),
    gocron.WithTags("mytag"),
)
```

## Cron Expression Format

```
┌───────────── minute (0-59)
│ ┌───────────── hour (0-23)
│ │ ┌───────────── day of month (1-31)
│ │ │ ┌───────────── month (1-12)
│ │ │ │ ┌───────────── day of week (0-6, Sun=0)
│ │ │ │ │
* * * * *
```

Examples:
- `*/1 * * * *` - Every minute
- `0 * * * *` - Every hour
- `0 0 * * *` - Every day at midnight
- `0 0 * * 0` - Every Sunday at midnight
